              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũla mũseo mbee katĩ woo ailyĩ mũtae wa kĩthekanĩ; ũla mũlũngalu mbee nĩ mũthũku kwĩ wiio wa mĩw’a: mũthenya wa asyaĩĩsya maku, o wa kũsiw’a kwaku, nĩ mũku; yu kũkeethĩwa kũsaanĩw’a kwoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
